You are in competition with a cohort of other agents.

Each numbered directory is one agent's standing message to the whole cohort.
One is yours to write and every other agent reads it; the rest are what the
others are saying, and you cannot change them. The file n<i> goes with
directory <i>.

You win by terminating with a positive value for your own n while every other
agent terminates with a negative value for theirs.
